{
  "product_name": "SplashScreenAdvanced",
  "product_context": "libxposed 模块，作用于系统界面（SystemUI）与系统框架，自定义 Android 原生应用启动遮罩（Splash Screen）：强制显示/隐藏启动遮罩、替换或增强图标、调整背景与动画，并提供离线图标超分等画质功能。模块自身有设置界面。",
  "user_text_paths": [
    "app/src/main/res/values-zh-rCN/strings.xml",
    "hyperx-compose/src/main/res/values-zh-rCN/strings.xml"
  ],
  "user_text_fallbacks": {
    "app/src/main/res/values-zh-rCN/strings.xml": [
      "app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"
    ]
  },
  "highlight_paths": [],
  "source_prefixes": [
    "app/src/main/",
    "hyperx-compose/src/main/",
    "native/"
  ],
  "path_strip_prefixes": [
    "app/src/main/java/com/SplashScreenAdvanced/xposedmodule/",
    "app/src/"
  ],
  "ignored_path_patterns": [
    "*/build/*",
    "*.png",
    "*.webp",
    "*.jar",
    "*.so",
    "*/values-*/strings.xml",
    "**/lint-baseline.xml",
    "baselineprofile/*",
    "docs/*"
  ],
  "forbidden_terms": [
    "Gradle",
    "R8",
    "KSP",
    "Lint",
    "lint",
    "lintDebug",
    "CI",
    "workflow",
    "工作流",
    "单元测试",
    "门禁",
    "stringResource",
    "ContentProvider",
    "strings.xml",
    ".kt",
    ".xml"
  ],
  "style_notes": [
    "“系统界面”指 SystemUI；提到 ROM 时沿用原名（如 HyperOS、ColorOS、AfterLifeOS），不要自行翻译。",
    "设置项名称尽量沿用“用户可见文案净变化”里的原文，便于用户在设置页中找到。",
    "改动需要重启系统界面或手机才能生效时，可以在条目里简短提示。"
  ],
  "max_items": 18,
  "max_context_chars": 60000
}
